  (text "POWER NOTES\n- VIN = USB-C VBUS (after STUSB4500 load switch) OR 12-15 V DC jack, Schottky OR.\n- U101 LT3757 SEPIC -> +18V4, U102 LT3757 Cuk/inverting -> -18V4, U103 LT3757 boost -> +50V (phantom).\n  LT3757: FBX = +1.6 V / -0.8 V, RT 41.2k = 300 kHz, SENSE limit 110 mV (datasheet).\n- U104 TPS7A4701 ANY-OUT +16.0 V (6.4+6.4+1.6+0.2 grounded), U106 TPS7A4701 +5.0 V (3.2+0.4).\n- U105 TPS7A3301 -16.1 V: Vout = -1.176 V x (1 + 127k/10k).  Pad and EN per datasheet (pad = GND, EN = IN).\n- U107 LT3042 +3V3A clean (oscillators, converters). U108/U109 TPS62130 bucks -> +3V3D / +0V9 (XMOS core).\n- Q104 capacitance multiplier: +50V -> ~+48.6 V phantom supply (4.7k / 100u base filter).\n- VERIFY: TPS62130 FSW pin sense (GND = high freq?), MOSFET/inductor choices, LT3757 compensation."
    (at 20 554 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "171b8cbf-afc1-5eb6-9c49-f76c7c465f76")
  )
